{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for the site's official social profiles.
  Rendered (not included) so it stays scope-isolated; outputs a CSV string
  of "name|icon|url" entries, one per profile, joined by commas.
  Consumers: {% capture social_links_csv %}{% render 'customcode-social-links' %}{% endcapture %}
  then split on ',' and '|' to get each profile's name, icon key, and URL.
{%- endcomment -%}
